    "stem": "Leela fills two upright plastic bottles with water. Bottle P is tall and narrow; the water surface is 30 cm above a side hole near the base. Bottle Q is short and wide; it holds more water in total, but its water surface is only 12 cm above an identical side hole.\n\nShe opens both holes at the same time.",
